99 token for high-resolution iTunes artwork (#7104)\n\n## Description\n\nFollow-up to #7045 (thanks to @Kernald for flagging the compression\ndifference).\n\nIn #7045, we replaced the legacy `\"100000x100000-999\"` token with\n`\"3000x3000bb\"` because Apple's `daiquiri/5` CDN began rejecting\n`\"100000x100000-999\"` with `HTTP 400 Bad Request`.\n\nTesting against `mzstatic.com` shows two things:\n1. **Why `\"100000x100000-999\"` returned `HTTP 400`**: Apple's CDN\nenforces an exact maximum dimension limit of `10000`px\n(`10000x10000-999` returns `200 OK`; `10001x10001-999` returns `400 Bad\nRequest`).\n2. **Why `\"3000x3000bb\"` returned smaller/re-compressed images**:\n- Omitting the `-999` quality modifier causes Apple's CDN to re-encode\nimages at JPEG Quality 94 with `4:2:0` chroma subsampling\n(`2x2,1x1,1x1`), whereas `-999` serves JPEG Quality 100 (all-`1`s\nquantization table) with `4:4:4` full chroma (`1x1,1x1,1x1`).\n- Capping dimensions at `3000x3000` downscales `4000x4000` masters\n(e.g., Daft Punk's *Random Access Memories (10th Anniversary Edition)*\nor Radiohead's *OK Computer*) to `3000x3000`.\n\n### Comparison on `mzstatic.com`\n\nFor Daft Punk's *Random Access Memories (10th Anniversary Edition)*\n(`4000x4000` master):\n- `100000x100000-999.jpg` -> `HTTP 400 Bad Request`\n- `3000x3000bb.jpg` -> `3000x3000`, `1,066,767` bytes (Quality 94,\n`4:2:0` chroma)\n- `10000x10000-999.jpg` -> `4000x4000`, `7,619,736` bytes (Quality 100,\n`4:4:4` chroma)\n\n## Solution\n\nUse `\"10000x10000-999\"` when `high_resolution` is enabled, and update\nthe `Unreleased` changelog entry from #7045 in place.\n\n## To Do\n\n- [x] Documentation.\n- [x] Changelog. (Updated the `Unreleased` entry from #7045 in place).\n- [x] Tests. (Updated `test_itunesstore_artwork_url_resolution` in\n`test/plugins/test_art.py`).","upstream_url":"https://github.com/beetbox/beets/commit/736df2d7c776842204dabe52a417f3235cf1b58d"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/config","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","BEETSDIR=/config","EDITOR=nano"],"exposed_ports":["8337/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-beets/releases/tag/nightly-736df2d7-ls4","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/files.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/files.arm64.json.gz"},"sbom":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/packages.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/packages.arm64.json.gz"},"run_json":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-beets/releases/download/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/run.json","logs_zip":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-beets/releases/download/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/logs.zip","test_report":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/site/images/beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/","tests":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-736df2d7-ls4/tests.json","report